repository-code: 'https://github.com/REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-USERNAME/ecg-cross-dataset-variance'
abstract: >-
  Code and per-seed results for a study of how much of the reported
  uncertainty in cross-dataset evaluation of electrocardiogram
  classifiers comes from the evaluation set and how much from the
  training procedure. Four detectors spanning supervised deep,
  unsupervised deep and classical feature-based families are trained on
  PTB-XL and transferred, frozen, to the MIT-BIH Arrhythmia Database,
  with five-seed replication and a reverse-direction test.
keywords:
  - electrocardiogram
  - cross-dataset validation
  - training variance
  - reproducibility
  - domain shift
  - anomaly detection
